    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "hound"
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Iron Cordon Brigade packet sheet \u2014 Aegis Spotter-Hound.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/iron-legion.json</code> (entry <code>aegis-spotter-hound</code>): Medium construct (hound), Unaligned; CR 1 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with STR); AC 14 (segmented iron plates), hit points 26 (4d8+8), speed 45 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Iron Cordon Brigade article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Engineered at Aegis Command to hunt deserters and flush out partisans hiding in rough terrain. Spotter-Hounds run ahead of patrol infantry, latching onto intruders and raising an ear-splitting alarm.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> pursuit & tracking \u00b7 <strong>tier:</strong> Clockwork Beast \u00b7 <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Surveillance & Recon.</p><h3>Art</h3><p><strong>Awaiting its plate.</strong> The render <code>npc-forge/iron-legion/renders/aegis-spotter-hound.png</code> has not been cut yet; run the NPC Forge (or <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py plates iron-legion</code>) and rebuild. Seed 510009. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, cold iron and gunmetal grey armor, brass gears, glowing cyan star-bit conduits, flat colours, crisp shading. A ferocious quadrupedal mechanical hound forged from blackened iron and riveted steel plates. Glowing amber optic sensors in its visor, steam venting from brass exhaust pipes along its spine, and powerful hydraulic jaws. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
